{"story":{"id":"event-first-contact-435","title":{"zh":"点亮屏幕","en":"Light Displays"},"category":"society","kind":"family","image":"art/b9c89635229802fe5b98.webp","start":"first_contact.430","chapters":5,"visible":true,"excerpt":{"zh":"对[This.ContactCountry.GetName]的研究越是深入，[This.Owner.GetResearchers]越是困惑。虽然他们显然是有智慧的生物，但他们的交流方式前所未闻。我们所接收到的不是某种基于音频或文本的信号，而是一场由它们的身体或数码设备带来的精彩的炫光表演，其发出的光的光谱还明显超出了[This.Owner.GetSpeciesNamePlural]的可视范围。很明显，要了解它们将是一个重大挑战。","en":"The more we learn about the [This.ContactCountry.GetName], the more puzzled our [This.Owner.GetResearchers] are. Although they are evidently intelligent beings, their transmissions are like nothing we have ever seen before. Instead of some sort of audio or scr"},"review":{"status":"reviewed","date":"2026-10-13","reviewer":"c7b-society (resumed)","scope":{"zh":"章鱼人光语链全部事件、项目及阶段衔接。","en":"The whole Octopodes light-language chain: events, project and stage hand-offs."},"sources":["events/first_contact_events.txt:6587-6737","common/special_projects/00_projects_nemesis.txt:77-90","common/first_contact/00_first_contact.txt:604-642","common/first_contact/00_first_contact.txt:2054-2130"],"uncertain":["437 另有 on_post_communications_established 触发（00_on_actions.txt:2268），未并入本篇的另一入口。 / 437 also has an on_action entry (00_on_actions.txt:2268)."],"guide":"public/summaries/event-first-contact-435.md"},"tree":{"root":"n0","nodes":{"n0":{"doc":null,"children":["n1"]},"n1":{"doc":"first_contact.430","parent":"n0","via":{"kind":"entry","triggers":[{"zh":"首次接触","en":"First contact"}]},"children":["n2","n3"]},"n2":{"doc":"first_contact.440","parent":"n1","via":{"kind":"bridge","label":{"zh":"进入阶段：章鱼人收尾阶段（坚持，对方主动）(难度8) / 章鱼人收尾阶段（坚持，对方谨慎）(难度10)","en":"Stage: octopodes end stage (persevered, proactive) (difficulty 8) / octopodes end stage (persevered, cautious) (difficulty 10)"},"conditional":true,"source":"content/stories/event-first-contact-435.json","optionIndex":0,"option":"first_contact.430.A"},"children":[]},"n3":{"doc":"first_contact.435","parent":"n1","via":{"kind":"bridge","label":{"zh":"进入阶段：章鱼人收尾阶段（拨款，对方主动）(难度5) / 章鱼人收尾阶段（拨款，对方谨慎）(难度7)","en":"Stage: octopodes end stage (funded, proactive) (difficulty 5) / octopodes end stage (funded, cautious) (difficulty 7)"},"conditional":true,"source":"content/stories/event-first-contact-435.json","optionIndex":1,"option":"first_contact.430.B"},"children":["n4"]},"n4":{"doc":"special_projects:OCTOPODES_LIGHT_PATTERNS_PROJECT","parent":"n3","via":{"option":"FASCINATING","optionIndex":0,"kind":"option","source":"events/first_contact_events.txt:6680"},"children":["n5"]},"n5":{"doc":"first_contact.437","parent":"n4","via":{"hooks":["on_success"],"kind":"project","source":"common/special_projects/00_projects_nemesis.txt:89"},"children":[]}}}},"chapters":[{"id":"first_contact.430","kind":"event","title":{"zh":"点亮屏幕","en":"Light Displays"},"texts":[{"zh":"对[This.ContactCountry.GetName]的研究越是深入，[This.Owner.GetResearchers]越是困惑。虽然他们显然是有智慧的生物，但他们的交流方式前所未闻。我们所接收到的不是某种基于音频或文本的信号，而是一场由它们的身体或数码设备带来的精彩的炫光表演，其发出的光的光谱还明显超出了[This.Owner.GetSpeciesNamePlural]的可视范围。很明显，要了解它们将是一个重大挑战。","en":"The more we learn about the [This.ContactCountry.GetName], the more puzzled our [This.Owner.GetResearchers] are. Although they are evidently intelligent beings, their transmissions are like nothing we have ever seen before. Instead of some sort of audio or script-based signal, what we are receiving is a brilliant light show - produced by their bodies or digitally - that stretches well beyond the light spectrum [This.Owner.GetSpeciesNamePlural] are able to view unaided. It is evident that coming to understand them will be a major challenge."}],"sections":[],"image":"art/b9c89635229802fe5b98.webp","hidden":false,"choices":[{"key":"first_contact.430.A","label":{"zh":"我们必须坚持下去。","en":"We will have to persevere."},"responses":[],"tooltips":[{"zh":"这可能要花点时间……","en":"This may take a while..."}],"conditional":false,"next":[{"target":"first_contact.440","kind":"bridge","conditional":true,"delayed":false,"sourceKind":"bridge","source":"content/stories/event-first-contact-435.json","label":{"zh":"进入阶段：章鱼人收尾阶段（坚持，对方主动）(难度8) / 章鱼人收尾阶段（坚持，对方谨慎）(难度10)","en":"Stage: octopodes end stage (persevered, proactive) (difficulty 8) / octopodes end stage (persevered, cautious) (difficulty 10)"},"story":"event-first-contact-435"}],"terminal":false},{"key":"first_contact.430.B","label":{"zh":"当然，一点额外的投资会有帮助？","en":"Surely some extra funding will help?"},"responses":[],"tooltips":[],"conditional":true,"next":[{"target":"first_contact.435","kind":"bridge","conditional":true,"delayed":false,"sourceKind":"bridge","source":"content/stories/event-first-contact-435.json","label":{"zh":"进入阶段：章鱼人收尾阶段（拨款，对方主动）(难度5) / 章鱼人收尾阶段（拨款，对方谨慎）(难度7)","en":"Stage: octopodes end stage (funded, proactive) (difficulty 5) / octopodes end stage (funded, cautious) (difficulty 7)"},"story":"event-first-contact-435"}],"terminal":false,"allow":[[{"type":"other","key":"resource_stockpile_compare","arg":"{…}","scope":"owner","value":true}]]}],"next":[],"source":{"file":"events/first_contact_events.txt","line":6586},"sets":["first_contact_octopodes_chain"],"names":{"This.ContactCountry.GetName":{"zh":"该帝国","en":"that empire"},"This.Owner.GetSpeciesNamePlural":{"zh":"该物种","en":"the species"}},"notes":[{"zh":"审阅注：与“嗡鸣者”结构相同：A坚持→无行动收尾（8/10）→440；B花费1000能量→拨款收尾（5/7）→435。","en":"Review note: same structure as the Hummers chain: A persevere → no-action end stage (8/10) → 440; B pay 1000 energy → funded end stage (5/7) → 435.","kind":"review"}]},{"id":"first_contact.440","kind":"event","title":{"zh":"光线组成的语言","en":"A Language of Lights"},"texts":[{"zh":"我们的努力得到了回报，现在我们基本能够理解[This.ContactCountry.GetName]的语言并与之沟通了。他们自称[This.ContactCountry.GetSpeciesNamePlural]，并说自己从未使用过口语，取而代之的是光线交流。虽然他们过去曾经使用过文字，但其民众认为它远不如视觉语言优雅高效。他们的大脑似乎完全胜任从复杂的图案中快速得出意义的工作，因此在大多数情况下，他们更喜欢使用视觉语言的交流形式。","en":"Our efforts have paid off, and we are now able to understand the light signals given off by the [This.ContactCountry.GetName] and communicate with them, at least on a rudimentary level. It appears that the [This.ContactCountry.GetSpeciesNamePlural], as they call themselves, never developed a spoken language and instead used their light displays. Though they used to use a written language, it is considered far less elegant and efficient than their visual language. Their brains seem perfectly adapted to rapidly derive meanings from even complex displays, so that they favor recordings of the latter in most cases."}],"sections":[],"image":"art/ed3acbe442c0a6616a3e.webp","hidden":false,"choices":[{"key":"first_contact.440.A","label":{"zh":"让我们看看他们有什么要说的。","en":"Let's see what they have to say."},"responses":[],"tooltips":[],"conditional":false,"next":[{"target":"galactic_features.387","kind":"option","conditional":true,"delayed":false,"sourceKind":"option","group":"c13020","when":[[[{"type":"other","key":"is_country_type","arg":"default","scope":"contact_country","value":false}],[{"type":"other","key":"has_first_contact_flag","arg":"hostile_first_contact_attempted","scope":"","value":true}]],[[{"type":"flag","scope":"country","name":"tiyanki_graveyard_survey","path":"","value":true}]]],"source":"common/scripted_effects/first_contact_effects.txt:178","story":"event-galactic-features-387"},{"target":"cara.1020","kind":"option","conditional":true,"delayed":false,"sourceKind":"option","group":"c13020","when":[[[{"type":"other","key":"is_country_type","arg":"default","scope":"contact_country","value":false}],[{"type":"other","key":"has_first_contact_flag","arg":"hostile_first_contact_attempted","scope":"","value":true}]],[[{"type":"other","key":"any_country","arg":"{…}","scope":"","value":true}]],[[{"type":"other","key":"exists","arg":"event_target:caravaneer_fleet1_country","scope":"","value":true},{"type":"other","key":"is_same_value","arg":"event_target:caravaneer_fleet1_country","scope":"","value":true}]]],"source":"common/scripted_effects/first_contact_effects.txt:437","story":"event-cara-1020"},{"target":"cara.