":true},{"type":"other","key":"is_current_first_contact_stage","arg":"default_end_stage_hostile_no_crew","scope":"","value":false},{"type":"other","key":"is_current_first_contact_stage","arg":"default_end_stage_hostile_with_vivisection","scope":"","value":false}],[{"type":"other","key":"is_current_first_contact_stage","arg":"default_end_stage_hostile_with_crew_easy","scope":"","value":true},{"type":"other","key":"is_current_first_contact_stage","arg":"default_end_stage_hostile_no_crew","scope":"","value":false},{"type":"other","key":"is_current_first_contact_stage","arg":"default_end_stage_hostile_with_vivisection","scope":"","value":false}],[{"type":"other","key":"is_current_first_contact_stage","arg":"default_end_stage_hostile_with_crew_hard","scope":"","value":true},{"type":"other","key":"is_current_first_contact_stage","arg":"default_end_stage_hostile_no_crew","scope":"","value":false},{"type":"other","key":"is_current_first_contact_stage","arg":"default_end_stage_hostile_with_vivisection","scope":"","value":false}]]],"source":"common/scripted_effects/first_contact_effects.txt:45","story":"event-first-contact-1110"}],"terminal":false}],"next":[],"source":{"file":"events/first_contact_events.txt","line":6655},"names":{"This.ContactCountry.GetName":{"zh":"该帝国","en":"that empire"},"This.ContactCountry.GetSpeciesNamePlural":{"zh":"该物种","en":"the species"}},"notes":[{"zh":"审阅注：435 启用特殊项目 OCTOPODES_LIGHT_PATTERNS_PROJECT（3000物理学），完成后触发 437。","en":"Review note: 435 enables the special project OCTOPODES_LIGHT_PATTERNS_PROJECT (3000 physics research); its completion fires 437.","kind":"review"}]},{"id":"special_projects:OCTOPODES_LIGHT_PATTERNS_PROJECT","kind":"project","title":{"zh":"[encountered_country.GetSpeciesAdj]图案","en":"[encountered_country.GetSpeciesAdj] Patterns"},"texts":[{"zh":"在与[encountered_country.GetSpeciesNamePlural]的接触过程中，我们发现他们用来沟通的发光模式和进出超空间航道的漩涡之间有着惊人的相似之处。对这个问题的进一步研究可能会使我们对星系的基本组成部分有所了解。","en":"During our encounter with the [encountered_country.GetSpeciesNamePlural], we discovered some astounding similarities between the patterns of light they use to communicate and the swirls of interstellar space that make hyperlane travel possible. Investigating further into this topic may shed some light on the fundamental building blocks of the galaxy."}],"sections":[],"image":"art/eb4bbc701c9bf528ec1d.webp","hidden":false,"choices":[],"next":[{"target":"first_contact.437","kind":"project","conditional":false,"delayed":false,"sourceKind":"project","source":"common/special_projects/00_projects_nemesis.txt:89","hooks":["on_success"],"story":"event-first-contact-435"}],"source":{"file":"common/special_projects/00_projects_nemesis.txt","line":78},"names":{"encountered_country.GetSpeciesNamePlural":{"zh":"该物种","en":"the species"},"encountered_country.GetSpeciesAdj":{"zh":"该族","en":"the species'"}}},{"id":"first_contact.437","kind":"event","title":{"zh":"超空间洞见","en":"Hyperlane Insights"},"texts":[{"zh":"我们对[encountered_country.GetSpeciesAdj]的漩涡状发光模式和星际空间之间的联系取得了令人惊讶的成果。似乎[encountered_country.GetSpeciesNamePlural]的发光规则在其不知道的情况下，竟与超空间随着时间的推移而流动的规则暗合，只是规模差别很大。\n\n之后，通过研究[encountered_country.GetSpeciesNamePlural]，我们将能够更好地预测超空间的流动，这将极大地扩展我们的传感器的探测范围。","en":"Our study into connections between patterns observed in interstellar space and the [encountered_country.GetSpeciesAdj] swirls of light has unearthed surprising results. It seems that the rules by which the [encountered_country.GetSpeciesNamePlural] make their light patterns are - unbeknownst to them, apparently - the same as those by which the flows of hyperlane space drift over time, just on a vastly different scale.\n\nIt follows that, through studying the [encountered_country.GetSpeciesNamePlural], we will be able to better predict the flows of hyperlane space - significantly boosting our potential sensor range."}],"sections":[],"image":"art/eb4bbc701c9bf528ec1d.webp","hidden":false,"choices":[{"key":"first_contact.437.A","label":{"zh":"我们面前打开了一个新世界。","en":"We are now open to new possibilities."},"responses":[],"tooltips":[],"conditional":false,"next":[],"terminal":false}],"next":[],"source":{"file":"events/first_contact_events.txt","line":6691},"names":{"encountered_country.GetSpeciesNamePlural":{"zh":"该物种","en":"the species"},"encountered_country.GetSpeciesAdj":{"zh":"该族","en":"the species'"}},"ending":{"label":{"zh":"结局：超空间航道的启示","en":"Ending: hyperlane insights"},"note":{"zh":"项目完成，获得“太空光影启示”修正。","en":"The project completes and grants the space_lights_insights modifier."}}}],"summary":{"text":"# 光影展示 / Light Displays\n- 分类 Category：文明纪事 Society (C7) · 首次接触阶段链 first-contact stage chain（首个事件「光影展示」first_contact.430）\n- 来源 Sources：`events/first_contact_events.txt:6587–6737` · `common/special_projects/00_projects_nemesis.txt:77–90` · `common/first_contact/00_first_contact.txt:604–642, 2054–2130`\n- 审阅 Reviewed：2026-10-13（c7b-society）\n\n## 如何开始 How it starts\n\n第二阶段抽取，权重 2（对方为水生/软体类 ×8）；要求本方持有 first_contact_skill 修正且不是荒野帝国，未发生过此链；对方不得是格式塔（`common/first_contact/00_first_contact.txt:605–642`）。/ Stage-2 weight 2 (×8 if the contact is aquatic or molluscoid); needs a first_contact_skill modifier, not a wilderness owner, no previous run; contact not gestalt.\n\n## 剧情脉络 Story outline\n\n1. **光影展示（430）**：对方用光线图案而非声音交流。/ They communicate with light patterns.\n   - A 坚持 → 无行动收尾（8/10）→ **440 光语**。/ Persevere → 440.\n   - B 追加经费（-1000 能量）→ 拨款收尾（5/7）→ **435 突破光障**。/ Fund → 435.\n2. 435 启用特殊项目“章鱼人光影图案”（3000 物理学）→ 完成后 **437 超空间航道启示**。/ 435 enables the Light Patterns project → 437.\n\n## 分支与结局 Branches and outcomes\n\n- 440 与 435 二选一；437 是项目的后续。/ 440 or 435; 437 follows the project.\n- 所有收尾选项都调用 finish_first_contact_effect（建立正式通讯，之后按帝国类型转入后续事件，如反向接触、教程、商队等），并调用 first_contact_inform_intel。 / Every ending option calls finish_first_contact_effect (opens regular communications, then routes to follow-ups such as reverse first contact, tutorial, caravaneer events) and first_contact_inform_intel.\n\n## 条件与文明差异 Conditions and variants\n\n只有选项B要求能量储备。/ Only option B requires energy.\n\n## 审阅记录 Review notes\n\n- 已核对 Checked：430–440、项目、四个章鱼人阶段、第二阶段条目。\n- 审阅改动 Changes：并入 430、440 与项目/437（原 event-first-contact-440 不再单独成篇）。/ 430, 440 and the project/437 merged in; the old 440 story is absorbed.\n- 不确定 Uncertain：437 还有 on_post_communications_established 入口，其触发条件未在此篇展开。/ 437 has a second on_action entry not expanded here.\n","path":"summaries/event-first-contact-435.md"}}